  "description": "Works to house:\r\n\r\nGrond floor- demolition of single storey side and rear extension, erection of single storey side and rear extension adjacent to No 38, erection of single storey infill extension adjacent to No 42. Internal alterations to stairs and doors.\r\n\r\nFirst floor - erection of timber railing to create terrace on roof of ground floor extension, installation of new doors opening onto terrace, internal alterations to create new bathroom.\r\n\r\nSecond floor- erection of dormer window to rear and internal alterations to create additional bedroom and bathroom.Installation of terrace on top of 1st floor dormer window.\r\n\r\nGarden- demolition of front wall and replacement timber gates and fencing, landscaping front garden to be store covered with bin stores and bike store, erection of new brick walls around the rear garden, erection of retractable garden shed and landscaping of rear garden to create store seats and stainless steel water fountain."
